%% OCR engine: QARI (NAMAA-Space/Qari-OCR-v0.3-VL-2B-Instruct) — Qwen2VL-based VLM, NOT Surya
%% NOTE: OCR integration at upload time inferred from DocumentProcessor pipeline; save_upload in file_service.py delegates details
sequenceDiagram
    participant Judge
    participant FastAPI
    participant MinIO
    participant QARIEngine
    participant TEIEmbedding
    participant Qdrant
    participant MongoDB

    Judge->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/files/upload (file, case_id)
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: validate MIME type (PDF/PNG/JPEG/TIFF/BMP/WebP) + size ≤20MB

    FastAPI->>MinIO: store binary → object_key
    MinIO-->>FastAPI: object_key

    alt image-based or PDF document
        FastAPI->>QARIEngine: run_ocr(file_path) [DocumentProcessor.OCR.ocr_pipeline]
        Note over QARIEngine: PDF rendered at 400 DPI per page
        QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: restore_image — CLAHE contrast normalization (LAB L-channel)
        QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: perspective_correct — Canny edge-contour\n+ adaptive-threshold fallback + safety guards
        QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: Qwen2VL inference (8-bit, GPU) — strict transcription\nno spelling correction, no dictionary lookup
        QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: normalize_numerals — Arabic-Indic digit normalization
        QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: compute_page_confidence — token softmax probabilities\n(page-level + per-word)
        QARIEngine-->>FastAPI: OCRDocumentResult (normalized_text, confidence per page)
    end

    FastAPI->>FastAPI: segment text into chunks

    FastAPI->>TEIEmbedding: embed(chunks) via BAAI/bge-m3
    TEIEmbedding-->>FastAPI: vectors[1024-dim]

    FastAPI->>Qdrant: upsert vectors + metadata → case_docs collection
    Note over Qdrant: metadata: case_id, doc_id, chunk_index, doc_type, party
    Qdrant-->>FastAPI: chunk_ids[]

    FastAPI->>MongoDB: store document record
    Note over MongoDB: doc_type, party, confidence_tier, object_key, chunk_ids[], case_id
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: document_id

    FastAPI-->>Judge: document_id + confidence tier
